  m_text: "If you're seeing this, it's too late for me. \n\nI thought I was free...
    I thought I had tracked down all the keys but turns out the last key isn't in
    the dungeon like I had thought.\n\n it's on Gordon. \n\nThere is no way out except
    through him."
